given-names>JT</given-names></name><etal/></person-group>  <article-title>HIV testing in national population-based surveys: experience from the demographic and health surveys.</article-title> <source>Bull World Health Organ</source> <year>2006</year>;<volume>84</volume>:<fpage>537</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>45</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16878227</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b7"><label>7</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><collab>MEASURE Demographic and Health Surveys Project</collab> <comment><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="www.measuredhs.com">www.measuredhs.com</ext-link> (accessed 7 January 2008)</comment></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b8"><label>8</label><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><collab>Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) [Kenya], Ministry of Health (MOH) [Kenya], ORC Macro</collab> <source>Kenya demographic and health survey 2003</source>. <publisher-loc>Calverton, MD</publisher-loc>: <publisher-name>CBS, MOH, and ORC Macro</publisher-name>, <year>2004</year></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b9"><label>9</label><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><collab>Central Statistical Agency [Ethiopia], ORC Macro</collab> <source>Ethiopia: demographic and health survey 2005</source>. <publisher-loc>Addis Ababa, Ethiopia and Calverton, MD</publisher-loc>: <publisher-name>Central Statistical Agency and ORC Macro</publisher-name>, <year>2006</year></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b10"><label>10</label><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><collab>Ministry of Health (MOH) [Uganda], ORC Macro</collab> <source>Uganda: HIV/AIDS sero-behavioural survey 2004-2005</source>. <publisher-loc>Calverton, MD</publisher-loc>: <publisher-name>Ministry of Health and ORC Macro</publisher-name>, <year>2006</year></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b11"><label>11</label><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><collab>National Statistical Office (NSO) [Malawi], ORC Macro</collab> <source>Malawi: demographic and health survey 2004</source>. <pu